:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="dolx-changelog">
		<div class="dolx-changelog-hero">
			<span class="dolx-changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>v0.20.15</span></h1>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="dolx-changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Updated to vanilla version 0.5.11.9
		</li>
		<li>Updated RBE to v0.5.4
		</li>
		<li>Reworked the Gentleman's Club letter
		<ul>
			<li>Great Hawk, the wolves, and Eden may fail to deliver the letter if they are away or if you visit at night. After one day, they give up and leave the letter at your home instead.
			</li>
			<li>Jordan become a courier after you officially join the temple as a monk or nun, and will keep the letter until you visit the temple.
			</li>
			<li>Great Hawk and the wolf pack now have a 25% chance to destroy the letter, just like Eden. If it is your first blackmail letter, this saves you from the task. Otherwise, the task immediately fails.
			</li>
			<li>Letter delivery now also works properly if you live at Avery's mansion. Avery may destroy the letter if their temper is low, saving you from the task. Otherwise, they leave it alone to avoid damaging their reputation.
			</li>
			<li>After unlocking Poppy's bedroom, they may also receive blackmail letters. If they are home and patient enough, they handle the letter for you; otherwise it is sent to your home like other failed deliveries.
			</li>
			<li>Landry's price for stopping the club's blackmail for one month has also been reduced from £15,000 to £10,000.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Chastity cage &amp; bullet vibe
		<ul>
			<li>Dildos and dildo chastity belts can no longer be worn at the same time. Inserting a dildo blocks the belt, while equipping the belt removes any dildo already inserted.
			</li>
			<li>Penis cages can now only be bought or equipped if the player has a penis. This applies to regular cages, small cages, and the fetish and flat variants, both in shops and wardrobes.
			</li>
			<li>Bought chastity gear can now only be removed at a wardrobe. Quick-undress scenes will no longer remove it.
			</li>
			<li>If the player gains a vagina while wearing a bought cage, the cage will fall off and be sent to the home wardrobe instead of turning into a belt. Cursed/non-removable cages will still transform as before.
			</li>
			<li>Chastity devices now slowly build arousal while worn. This passive arousal starts with a low limit, which gradually drops as you become used to the device over roughly two weeks of continuous wear. Removing the device causes this tolerance to fade slowly instead of resetting immediately. Direct stimulation from sex, masturbation, vibrators, parasites, and drugs is unaffected by the limit.
			</li>
			<li>Locked chastity devices now prevent normal arousal from having your penis or clit rubbed through clothing.
			</li>
			<li>Bought chastity devices now include a key. The key has a small chance to break when you try to unlock the device yourself, may go missing while you are unconscious, or may be stolen by an attacker who forces the device onto you. Whitney and Kylar can also take and keep your key.
			</li>
			<li>Sirris can remove a locked chastity device if you no longer have its key. However, cutting it off permanently destroys the device.
			</li>
			<li>The flat fetish chastity cage now increases penis shrinkage and hides the bulge beneath underwear.
			</li>
			<li>Bullet vibes now come with a remote. If the remote is lost, you can no longer control the vibe, and it will switch itself on and off at random. Its description will also warn that it is out of your control.
			</li>
			<li>A bullet vibe may work itself loose when you orgasm during sex or masturbation.
			</li>
			<li>Whitney's classroom vibrator scene returns the remote afterward.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Eligible players can now willingly submit when a plantperson escalates after a kiss, while retaining the option to fight.
		</li>
		<li>Genital wetness and penetration descriptions now stay synchronized with bodily fluids.
		</li>
		<li>The new-game character mannequin now shows the selected genitals correctly.
		</li>
		<li>Expanded the render side view, taking reference from Papperdoll+ by YazawaHY.
		</li>
		<li>Added an option to hide the version number at the top, for ModLoader users.
		</li>
		<li>Added modelling "poses" for the water dragon in the street modelling event.
		</li>
		<li>Added the Melusine chimera
		<ul>
			<li>Chimera TF Melusine GooseFem Art by: Axos (set) &amp; Cici (wings)
			</li>
			<li>No vanilla art for this moment
			</li>
			<li>Melusine automatically unlocks when the water dragon tail, angel halo, and harpy wings are all active. Each body part has its own Show/Hide toggle in the mirror's Chimera section, matching Ryuujin and Bakunawa.
			</li>
			<li>Also fixes Divine Wings and regular Wings rendering over each other when both are active, such as with Fallen Angel and Bird transformations.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Rebalancing</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Rebalanced the brothel
		<ul>
			<li>Working for Briar is now more demanding and less overwhelmingly profitable.
			</li>
			<li>Reduced ordinary client conversation, private appointment, and auction rates by 25%.
			</li>
			<li>Added fatigue to floor work, conversations, negotiations, appointments, and assaults.
			</li>
			<li>Added an 8% hostile-client risk when flirting or accepting private sexual appointments.
			</li>
			<li>Some hostile encounters can now involve groups of two to four patrons.
			</li>
			<li>Added public assaults where the surrounding brothel audience watches.
			</li>
			<li>Private clients can sometimes lock the door, bring in others, and refuse payment.
			</li>
			<li>Hostile encounters no longer award client payment; the player can report unpaid assaults to Briar from their office.
			</li>
			<li>Consensual appointments, skill rewards, fame gains, and normal tips remain available.
			</li>
			<li>These changes affect ordinary client work at Briar's brothel. Dancing, shows, gloryhole work, and underground brothel contracts keep their existing balance.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Fixes and Improvements</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Fixed the feat boost UI for mobile users.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the impurity sensitivity bonus
		<ul>
			<li>The "Sensitivity boost due to impurity" setting was increasing breast, bottom, and genital sensitivity even when the player was not under an X-Change pill effect. This was especially noticeable for virgin Demon-race characters, who could start the game with maximum genital sensitivity. The bonus now only applies while the player is actually X-Changed, as stated in the setting description.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the always-passout loop and body becoming cold.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed temple confession
		<ul>
			<li>Confession options for Promiscuity, Exhibitionism, and Deviancy now check the actual stored stat.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the Unstoppable Force feat, where there was a mismatch in the unlock requirement.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed transformation income bonuses
		<ul>
			<li>Demon income bonuses now apply correctly to paid street seduction, divine transformations boost complete tip payouts, and stolen goods from Bailey's Halloween event use the proper income bonus.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Bailey's sleep-rape event can now only interrupt your sleep once per day. Trying to sleep again on the same night will no longer trigger it repeatedly.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Character Viewer crashes and missing sprites.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Robin
		<ul>
			<li>Robin now keeps the correct pronouns while opening Christmas gifts. Tuxedo outfit handling, yearly Christmas resets, and related dialogue have also been fixed.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Bailey handholding scenes
		<ul>
			<li>Wearing gloves now prevents handholding virginity loss in Bailey's dinner date, Halloween, office, fishing, and farm scenes, matching the rest of the game.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Critter Magnet so it no longer penalises non-critter sex.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed hand sewing
		<ul>
			<li>Repairing all clothes now takes no more than two hours, targets the wardrobe currently being viewed, and includes fully broken worn clothes. Metal, plastic, parasite, and unrepairable items are no longer incorrectly repaired or charged spools.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Iron Will
		<ul>
			<li>Iron Will now turns off when the Fallen Angel transformation is reset and can be toggled from the mirror after being unlocked. Its willpower gain and decay bonuses now consistently follow the selected trait state, including on older saves.
			</li>
			<li>Add toggle for this skill in mirror.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed people magically being aware of your gender identity/genitals
		<ul>
			<li>Strangers, anonymous crowds, masked figures, and characters meeting you for the first time now react to your appearance rather than somehow knowing about you. Established partners and recurring characters are unaffected.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Flight and glide abilities now require actual wings.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed a crash in Avery's mansion bedroom that could affect players who had never visited the HBSC bank or had not yet completed their first month.
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the Kaiju costume and Whitney's collar unlocks
		<ul>
			<li>Existing saves will now correctly track the Kaiju costume and Whitney's collar at Gwylan's forest shop.
			</li>
			<li>Whitney's collar will unlock automatically the next time you visit the shop. To unlock the Kaiju costume, complete Niki's flyer job once more.
			</li>
			<li>Also fixed the wardrobe's Attach Leash option making the shop-bought collar permanently stuck. It will now only become unremovable if someone else attaches a leash while you are wearing it.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Avery's forced pilling
		<ul>
			<li>Avery now checks the player's current physical sex instead of their identity when deciding whether to force a pill. Gender Identity body changes, delayed Choice pills, reversal rewards, and mansion warnings now remain consistent.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Continue's orgasm
		<ul>
			<li>Continue now properly extends its duration when you orgasm, even while transformation progress is paused by pregnancy or advanced ear slime growth. This fix also applies to X-Changed NPCs. Their Continue duration will now follow the Cap Continue Duration setting as well.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Improved divine income bonuses
		<ul>
			<li>Players with the full Angel transformation now receive double the normal temple allowance. At 100 Grace, this awards £8,000. This applies to both the solo temple exam and Sydney's exam.
			</li>
			<li>Fixed several inconsistencies with Angel, Demon, and Fallen Angel money bonuses: the amount shown in messages now always matches the money you actually receive
			</li>
			<li>Divine bonuses only apply to genuine income, such as wages, sales, theft, charity, sex work, and direct rewards; refunds, repayments, returned gambling stakes, reimbursements, and money transfers no longer receive divine bonuses or count as earned income; refunds now return the exact amount originally paid, including any inflation added to the purchase; temple chastity, Robin's drinks, and cinema ticket refunds now correctly remember the amount paid; gambling stakes remain fixed and are not affected by inflation; Fallen Angel effects still take priority where intended
			</li>
			<li>Angel, Demon, and Fallen Angel trait descriptions now match their actual effects.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Bailey's blood moon event
		<ul>
			<li>After surviving Bailey's blood moon event, the game will now correctly move to the next morning instead of staying on the same date.
			</li>
			<li>The wraith's "Eggs in the serpent's nest" line can now appear if you have children.
			</li>
			<li>Successfully regaining control during the final struggle will no longer incorrectly say, "Your body does not obey."
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed orgasm denial during Gwylan's ritual
		<ul>
			<li>Addiction, Breeder, Alpha, and Omega effects no longer prevent orgasms during Gwylan's ritual. These effects return to normal after the ritual and still work in the forest-lure ritual and all other combat.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed temple chastity
		<ul>
			<li>Fixed a crash that could happen when refusing chastity removal after previously visiting Jordan for prayer.
			</li>
			<li>Jordan will no longer secretly change your purity, crime, or deviancy stats when resolving a refusal. Instead, you must earn enough of their trust through prayer or goodwill.
			</li>
			<li>Split the old "reputation" refusal into two clearer reasons: having a lewd reputation or being wanted for crimes.
			</li>
			<li>Added a "Plead with Jordan" option at low world corruption. This unlocks a soup kitchen charity event, giving you another way to earn their trust without praying.
			</li>
			<li>An X-Changed appearance can now help you bypass Jordan's chastity refusal early, similar to the spa and bank.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Fame Values
		<ul>
			<li>Restored several negative fame gains that were accidentally reduced during the fame rebalance, including exhibitionism, rape, sex, bestiality, and prostitution fame. All positive fame buffs from the rebalance remain unchanged.
			</li>
			<li>X-Change fame now benefits from the same doubled fame gains as other fame types.
			</li>
			<li>The pub favour that changes your fame now works properly with fame bonuses, disguises, and recognition.
			</li>
			<li>Fixed sex fame having no maximum limit.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the temple staying dirty forever
		<ul>
			<li>Sydney can now gradually improve the temple's cleanliness. There is also a small chance each day, guaranteed at least once a week, that the whole congregation will help clean the temple.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed Poppy's treasure
		<ul>
			<li>Their stolen necklace now adds antique value instead of stolen goods value.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed the insanity trait
		<ul>
			<li>It now freezes/goes inactive during historical events and the Hopeless Cycle.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li>Fixed strap-ons in the brothel
		<ul>
			<li>Exposing yourself during sex, such as at a glory hole or in combat, could unequip your strap-on. This hid the strap-on option and the penis action menu when they were needed.
			</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
	</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon images" aria-hidden="true">&#128444;</span> Art and Image Updates</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Fixed the Goose soft penis image mod, the Goose chastity image mod, and the Whitney collar all-over graphic mod.
		</li>
		<li>Added Eden vanilla sprites by u/Wonderful_Can_7086.
		</li>
		<li>Added Great Hawk vanilla sprites by u/Wonderful_Can_7086.
		</li>
	</ul>
	</div>
<</widget>>
